{"version":1,"content":"<p>衛生防護中心今日（18日）公布，一名9歲過往健康良好的男童感染肺炎球菌，發病5天後不治。</p><p>初步調查顯示，男童於潛伏期內沒有外遊，其家居接觸者至今沒有出現病徵，個案將轉交死因裁判官調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T11:18:57.256656+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:35:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T20:57:34.507434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:17:32.579209+00:00","content_hash":"d7ef84dfbfaef2f2790aba90b7f5d9201b4f9041b85c68fa2e3fcdd848a78244","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}